{"author":{"id":"585844baa6074d44d241f46aa7c9f21ff46653adf617d7f070fbfe327626c989"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1795259960,"nonce":"577gaVgNpbd2hqIk7V0MITZFrgk=","title":"Typed buffers in hxn core: zero-copy struct-of-arrays storage shared with Rust and the GPU","message":"hxn has no typed buffer. Bytes cross the boundary as haxe.io.Bytes, and hxn-gpu uploads from Bytes. hxnme needs struct-of-arrays storage that Haxe, Rust libraries and the GPU all read without copying: component arrays, the physics engine ported from Chimpmonk, render instance data. Chimpmonk's `FloatBuffer` (chimpmonk/math/Simd.hx) shows the shape: an abstract over hl.Bytes with inline `buf[i]` and `ash.simd.Float32x4` interop. It exists only on HashLink targets.\n\nProposed:\n- `hxn.Float32Buffer`, `hxn.Int32Buffer` and similar: zero-cost abstracts with inline indexed access, fixed length, explicit growth that replaces the storage.\n- Backing per runtime: hl.Bytes on HashLink and Ash; a native allocation released by a finalizer on hxcpp, so the collector never moves memory a native call or the GPU holds; a region of linear memory on wasm.\n- hxn-gen accepts them as borrowed `\u0026[f32]` / `\u0026mut [f32]` (and the integer kinds) for the duration of a call, without copying, on every runtime.\n- hxn-gpu uploads directly from a buffer range (`writeBuffer(buffer, offset, data, start, count)`), so changed ranges reach GPU memory without an intermediate Bytes.\n- SIMD: `Float32x4` access through `ash.simd` on HashLink (simd.hdll on stock HashLink, compiled directly by the Ash JIT); a scalar path on hxcpp first, intrinsics later if profiling calls for them.\n\nQuestions to settle in the design: alignment guarantees (16 bytes for SIMD, GPU buffer offset rules), whether growth may move memory while a borrow is live (it must not), how a buffer is pinned across an asynchronous GPU upload, and Miri coverage for the borrowed-slice adapters.\n\nBlocks the physics port (Chimpmonk's physics into an hxnme plugin) and hxnme's component storage; see 88ad5eff5f418581d790175f13ad89d85d24c50e980dca23033b4d884329b3cd.","files":null}]}